the mind struggles to accept that evil on such a scale really is happening.  It&amp;#39;s akin to hearing that a loved one has suddenly died in a car crash: no, this can&amp;#39;t be so, this can&amp;#39;t be reality.  But it is.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I feel some glimmer of hope that, thanks to the efforts of people such as you, the nation is slowly, sluggishly waking up to what is going on.  Heck, even the MSM are making some noise, and they&amp;#39;ve traditionally been (and still mostly are) front and center brown-nosers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Keep it up, Will!  And stay safe from those deadly criminal gangs out there.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1239536965846588382/comments/default/741376735008948482'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1239536965846588382/comments/default/741376735008948482'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/blackmail-witness-tampering-criminal.html?showComment=1412170332684#c741376735008948482' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/blackmail-witness-tampering-criminal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1239536965846588382' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1239536965846588382' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-796506691"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 1, 2014 at 7:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3880950734161367731</id><published>2014-09-30T10:39:40.677-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-30T10:39:40.677-06:00</updated><title type='text'