ayments as the payoff. Thats the core foundation to all of this stuff. Remove the retirement packages and most of this stuff will go away in a flash.  Mankind has always been known to show the worst side of the human race for greed, with money being the core foundation of that greed. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1239536965846588382/comments/default/8313526406174467633'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1239536965846588382/comments/default/8313526406174467633'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/blackmail-witness-tampering-criminal.html?showComment=1412079769565#c8313526406174467633' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/09/blackmail-witness-tampering-criminal.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1239536965846588382' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1239536965846588382' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-425182497"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 30, 2014 at 6:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1980631955602129889</id><published>2014-09-30T03:19:51.405-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-30T03:19:51.405-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Not surprised at all, having lived in Flathead Cou...</title><content type='html'>Not surprised at all, having lived in Flathead County much of my life (and kudos to Baldwin &amp;amp; the Quatmans)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But the bear stories are infinitely more entertaining:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://ronaldthomaswest.com/2012/1